  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1887,
      "versionNonce": 417602061,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "hjBS1SiSCqIN-9ewdm4q8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 281.08859882548313,
      "y": 5535.339733403483,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 1109.751708984375,
      "height": 1680,
      "seed": 1495055681,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1709822978119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "El calculo de cuantos posibles casos esta dado por\ncon el método de construir el árbol: \n3raizarbol*(3azulez*2rojos*3verdes) = 54 \n\ncon el método de combinaciones:\n8C2 = 28\n\nP(X=0; y=0) = 6/56 = (3C2)/28  = 3/28 = 0,107142857\nP(X=1; y=0) = /56 = (3C1*3C1)/28 = 9/28 = 0,321428571\nP(X=2; y=0) = 6/56 = (3C2)/28  = 3/28 = 0,107142857\nP(X=0; y=1) = /56 = (2C1*3C1)/28 = 6/28 = 0,214285714\nP(X=0; y=2) = /56 = (2C2)/28   = 1/28  = 0,035714285\nP(X=1; y=1) = /56 = (3C1*2C1)/28  = 6/28 = 0,214285714\n\nc) \nE(X) = 0*10/28 + 1*15/28 + 2*3/28 + 3*0 = 21/28 = 0,75\n\nE(Y) = 0*15/28 + 1*12/28 + 2*1/28 = 14/28 = 0,5\n\nE(X,Y) = 0*0*3/28 + 0*1*9/28 + 0*2*3/28 + 1*0*6/28 \n        + 1*1*6/28 + 2*0*1/28\n      = 2/28 = 0,071428571 \n\nCov(X;Y) = E(X,Y) - E(X)*E(Y) = 2/28 - (0,75 * 0,5) = 2/28 - 0,375\n         = -0,303571428\n\nd) P(X+Y<=1) = P(X=0;Y=0) + P(X=0;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=0) = \n             = 3/28 + 9/28 + 6/28 = 18/28 = 0,642857142\n\nFx(1) = P(X=1;Y=0) + P(X=1;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=2) = \n     = 9/28 + 6/28 + 0 = 15/28 = 0,535714285\n\nF(0;2) = P(X=0;Y=0) + P(X=0;Y=1) + P(X=0;Y=2) = \n       = 3/28 + 6/28 + 1/28 =  10/28 = 0,357142857\n\n\nP(X<=1/Y>=1) = P(X<=1;Y>=1) / P(Y>=1) = \n             = [P(X=0;Y=1) + P(X=0;Y=2) + P(X=1;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=2)]\n                          1 - P(Y<1)\n             = 6/28 + 1/28 + 6/28 + 0\n                     1 -  15/28\n             = 13/28\n                13/28\n             = 1\n\n\ne) Para que X e Y sean independientes se debe dar que E(XY) = E(X)E(Y)\nen este caso 2/28 != -0,375 Por lo tanto no son variables independientes",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "El calculo de cuantos posibles casos esta dado por\ncon el método de construir el árbol: \n3raizarbol*(3azulez*2rojos*3verdes) = 54 \n\ncon el método de combinaciones:\n8C2 = 28\n\nP(X=0; y=0) = 6/56 = (3C2)/28  = 3/28 = 0,107142857\nP(X=1; y=0) = /56 = (3C1*3C1)/28 = 9/28 = 0,321428571\nP(X=2; y=0) = 6/56 = (3C2)/28  = 3/28 = 0,107142857\nP(X=0; y=1) = /56 = (2C1*3C1)/28 = 6/28 = 0,214285714\nP(X=0; y=2) = /56 = (2C2)/28   = 1/28  = 0,035714285\nP(X=1; y=1) = /56 = (3C1*2C1)/28  = 6/28 = 0,214285714\n\nc) \nE(X) = 0*10/28 + 1*15/28 + 2*3/28 + 3*0 = 21/28 = 0,75\n\nE(Y) = 0*15/28 + 1*12/28 + 2*1/28 = 14/28 = 0,5\n\nE(X,Y) = 0*0*3/28 + 0*1*9/28 + 0*2*3/28 + 1*0*6/28 \n        + 1*1*6/28 + 2*0*1/28\n      = 2/28 = 0,071428571 \n\nCov(X;Y) = E(X,Y) - E(X)*E(Y) = 2/28 - (0,75 * 0,5) = 2/28 - 0,375\n         = -0,303571428\n\nd) P(X+Y<=1) = P(X=0;Y=0) + P(X=0;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=0) = \n             = 3/28 + 9/28 + 6/28 = 18/28 = 0,642857142\n\nFx(1) = P(X=1;Y=0) + P(X=1;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=2) = \n     = 9/28 + 6/28 + 0 = 15/28 = 0,535714285\n\nF(0;2) = P(X=0;Y=0) + P(X=0;Y=1) + P(X=0;Y=2) = \n       = 3/28 + 6/28 + 1/28 =  10/28 = 0,357142857\n\n\nP(X<=1/Y>=1) = P(X<=1;Y>=1) / P(Y>=1) = \n             = [P(X=0;Y=1) + P(X=0;Y=2) + P(X=1;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=1) + P(X=1;Y=2)]\n                          1 - P(Y<1)\n             = 6/28 + 1/28 + 6/28 + 0\n                     1 -  15/28\n             = 13/28\n                13/28\n             = 1\n\n\ne) Para que X e Y sean independientes se debe dar que E(XY) = E(X)E(Y)\nen este caso 2/28 != -0,375 Por lo tanto no son variables independientes",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
