      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1709822978119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "c) i)  P(X<=2; Y=1) = P(X=0; Y=1) + P(X=1; Y=1) + P(X=2; Y=1) = 1/30 + 2/30 + 3/30\n                   = 6/30 = 0,2\n\nii) P(X>2; Y<=1) = P(X=3; Y=0) + P(X=3; Y=1) = 4/30 + 3/30 = 7/30 = 0,233333333\n\niii) P(X > Y) = P(X=1; Y=0) + P(X=2; Y=0) + P(X=3; Y=0) + P(X=2; Y=1) + P(X=3; Y=1)  \n               + P(X=3; Y=2) \n            = 1/30 + 2/30 + 3/30 + 3/30 + 4/30 + 5/30 = 18/30 = 0,6\n\n\niv) P(X+Y = 4) = P(X=3; Y=1) + P(X=2; Y=2) = 4/30 + 4/30 = 8/30 = 0,266666666 ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "c) i)  P(X<=2; Y=1) = P(X=0; Y=1) + P(X=1; Y=1) + P(X=2; Y=1) = 1/30 + 2/30 + 3/30\n                   = 6/30 = 0,2\n\nii) P(X>2; Y<=1) = P(X=3; Y=0) + P(X=3; Y=1) = 4/30 + 3/30 = 7/30 = 0,233333333\n\niii) P(X > Y) = P(X=1; Y=0) + P(X=2; Y=0) + P(X=3; Y=0) + P(X=2; Y=1) + P(X=3; Y=1)  \n               + P(X=3; Y=2) \n            = 1/30 + 2/30 + 3/30 + 3/30 + 4/30 + 5/30 = 18/30 = 0,6\n\n\niv) P(X+Y = 4) = P(X=3; Y=1) + P(X=2; Y=2) = 4/30 + 4/30 = 8/30 = 0,266666666 ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
