      "text": "b) P(X = -2/Y=3) = (5/15) / 9/15 = 5/9 = 0,555555555\nP(X = 0/Y=3) = (3/15) / 9/15 = 5/15 = 3/9 = 0,333333333\nP(X = 2/Y=3) = (1/15) / 9/15 = 1/9 = 0,111111111\n\nc) i) P(X<=0; Y>=3) = P(X=0; Y=3) + P(X=-2; Y=3) = \n                    = 5/15 + 3/15 = 8/15 = 0,533333333\n\nii) P(X=0; Y=0) = 0\n\niii) P(X<=0; Y=3) = P(X=0; Y=3) + P(X=-2; Y=3)\n                 = 5/15 + 3/15 = 8/15 = 0,533333333\n\niv)E(X/Y=3) = -2*5/9 + 0*3/9 + 2*1/9 \n            = -10/9 + 0 + 2/9 = -8/9 = -0,888888888\n\nd)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "b) P(X = -2/Y=3) = (5/15) / 9/15 = 5/9 = 0,555555555\nP(X = 0/Y=3) = (3/15) / 9/15 = 5/15 = 3/9 = 0,333333333\nP(X = 2/Y=3) = (1/15) / 9/15 = 1/9 = 0,111111111\n\nc) i) P(X<=0; Y>=3) = P(X=0; Y=3) + P(X=-2; Y=3) = \n                    = 5/15 + 3/15 = 8/15 = 0,533333333\n\nii) P(X=0; Y=0) = 0\n\niii) P(X<=0; Y=3) = P(X=0; Y=3) + P(X=-2; Y=3)\n                 = 5/15 + 3/15 = 8/15 = 0,533333333\n\niv)E(X/Y=3) = -2*5/9 + 0*3/9 + 2*1/9 \n            = -10/9 + 0 + 2/9 = -8/9 = -0,888888888\n\nd)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
