      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "= E[(X - E[X])^1 (Y -E[Y])^1] = E(X;Y) =\n= Cov(X,Y) = E(X;Y) -E(X)E(Y)\n= -2*-2*0 + -2*0*2/15 + -2*2*4/15 + 3*-2*5/15\n  + 3*0*3/15 + 3*2*1/15\n= -16/15 -2 + 2/5\n= -8/3 = -2,666666667",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "= E[(X - E[X])^1 (Y -E[Y])^1] = E(X;Y) =\n= Cov(X,Y) = E(X;Y) -E(X)E(Y)\n= -2*-2*0 + -2*0*2/15 + -2*2*4/15 + 3*-2*5/15\n  + 3*0*3/15 + 3*2*1/15\n= -16/15 -2 + 2/5\n= -8/3 = -2,666666667",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
